<title>SINGAPORE: Cebu Shipyard interim profit flat.</title>
<headline>Cebu Shipyard interim profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover	     164.842  vs   173.847</p>
<p>    Net income	    28.170  vs    27.769</p>
<p>Note - Cebu Shipyard and Engineering Works Inc is part of Keppel Corp.</p>
